  "sourceTitle": "Aromatic Rice",
  "sourceText": "Aromatic Rice\nBy: Abby\nPublished: Sunday, September 9, 2012 - 2:48pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Basmati Rice\nWater (as directed)\n2 teaspoons (or more) Indian Cumin Seed\nPinch of Saffron\n2-3 Whole Cloves\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook rice as directed, but add in the clove, saffron, and Indian cumin seed when you add the rice and cook all together. 2 Remove the cloves before serving!",
